WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.328 --> 00:00:17.141
Dr. Dolittle the animals walked back into King Jolliginki's land.

2
00:00:17.921 --> 00:00:21.424
They hoped to get back to the sea and find a way to return home.

3
00:00:21.444 --> 00:00:25.608
"We must be very quiet," Polynesia whispered.

4
00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:30.112
"If King Jolliginki hears us, he will send out the guards again."

5
00:00:33.752 --> 00:00:35.713
Everyone was hungry and tired.

6
00:00:36.313 --> 00:00:38.334
Gub-Gub could not stop crying.

7
00:00:44.315 --> 00:00:46.876
find some food for you," said Chee-Chee.

8
00:00:47.376 --> 00:00:48.697
He jumped into a tree.

9
00:00:48.717 --> 00:00:52.938
"Some coconuts?"

10
00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:54.419
Gub-Gub sniffed.

11
00:00:55.139 --> 00:00:58.960
While Chee-Chee went off to look for food, Polynesia led the group.

12
00:01:02.008 --> 00:01:03.889
After a while, they got lost.

13
00:01:03.909 --> 00:01:07.771
"I'm sure it's this way," Polynesia said.

14
00:01:07.791 --> 00:01:11.533
"We just came from there," complained Dab-Dab.

15
00:01:11.554 --> 00:01:14.695
"Oh, where is Chee-Chee?

16
00:01:15.256 --> 00:01:18.838
I'm so hungry," cried Gub-Gub.

17
00:01:18.858 --> 00:01:20.919
"Be QUIET!"

18
00:01:22.199 --> 00:01:23.660
everyone yelled at the pig.

19
00:01:25.161 --> 00:01:26.802
Everyone felt like giving up.

20
00:01:28.143 --> 00:01:29.944
"Wait! Look over there!"

21
00:01:30.576 --> 00:01:32.357
Gub-Gub pointed excitedly.

22
00:01:33.237 --> 00:01:35.098
In front of them were fruit trees.

23
00:01:35.798 --> 00:01:37.499
Polynesia shook her head.

24
00:01:37.519 --> 00:01:39.640
"I don't think it's that way."

25
00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:42.641
"But we're so hungry!"

26
00:01:43.181 --> 00:01:44.222
cried the animals.

27
00:01:44.902 --> 00:01:46.783
So they ran toward the trees.

28
00:01:46.803 --> 00:01:48.343
"At last!

29
00:01:48.703 --> 00:01:50.804
Food!" shouted Gub-Gub.

30
00:01:53.705 --> 00:01:56.126
Unfortunately, they had made a big mistake.

31
00:01:56.807 --> 00:01:59.668
They had walked right into King Jolliginki's garden!

32
00:02:00.776 --> 00:02:02.697
"This time you will not escape!"

33
00:02:03.258 --> 00:02:04.118
one guard said.

34
00:02:04.759 --> 00:02:07.721
Dr. Dolittle and the animals were taken away.

35
00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:11.123
But Polynesia escaped once again.

36
00:02:13.624 --> 00:02:16.166
Meanwhile, Chee-Chee was very upset.

37
00:02:16.186 --> 00:02:18.127
"Where are they?"

38
00:02:18.748 --> 00:02:19.368
he wondered.

39
00:02:20.129 --> 00:02:21.189
He looked and looked.

40
00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:22.790
But it was no use.

41
00:02:23.271 --> 00:02:24.792
He could not find his friends.

42
00:02:28.488 --> 00:02:31.651
Dr. Dolittle stood before King Jolliginki again.

43
00:02:31.671 --> 00:02:36.816
"Please, I must get back to Puddleby," the doctor explained.

44
00:02:37.616 --> 00:02:39.478
The king laughed unkindly.

45
00:02:43.441 --> 00:02:44.723
are going nowhere!"

46
00:02:44.743 --> 00:02:47.405
"Please, you must let me Dr.

47
00:02:48.166 --> 00:02:51.869
Dolittle tried to speak but the king got angry.

48
00:02:51.889 --> 00:02:54.011
"Take him to the dungeon!"

49
00:02:54.451 --> 00:02:55.072
he roared.

50
00:02:57.944 --> 00:03:00.386
Finally, Chee-Chee found Polynesia.

51
00:03:01.086 --> 00:03:02.707
She explained what had happened.

52
00:03:02.727 --> 00:03:05.189
"The jungle is your home!

53
00:03:05.649 --> 00:03:07.030
How can you get lost?"

54
00:03:07.430 --> 00:03:08.211
he scolded.

55
00:03:08.231 --> 00:03:11.373
"Ssh!" Polynesia whispered.

56
00:03:12.254 --> 00:03:14.495
Below them a young man walked by.

57
00:03:16.817 --> 00:03:18.558
He sat down under a tree.

58
00:03:18.578 --> 00:03:21.220
"Who cares if I am a prince?"

59
00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:22.581
the man said.

60
00:03:22.601 --> 00:03:25.723
"That must be King Jolliginki's son!"

61
00:03:26.323 --> 00:03:27.264
Chee-Chee whispered.

62
00:03:27.944 --> 00:03:29.405
The prince took his hat off.

63
00:03:29.806 --> 00:03:33.729
Sighing, he said, "I would do anything to have hair!"

64
00:03:36.771 --> 00:03:39.553
Polynesia began to blink very fast.

65
00:03:40.354 --> 00:03:41.835
This meant she was thinking.

66
00:03:41.855 --> 00:03:44.497
"Chee-Chee! I have a plan!"

67
00:03:45.118 --> 00:03:46.159
Polynesia said.

68
00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:48.440
She told him her idea.

69
00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:50.182
"You're crazy!

70
00:03:50.622 --> 00:03:52.103
It's too dangerous!"

71
00:03:52.784 --> 00:03:54.365
Chee-Chee refused to help.

72
00:03:55.086 --> 00:03:57.648
But in the end, the monkey agreed to help.

73
00:04:00.672 --> 00:04:03.373
Chee-Chee and Polynesia hid behind the leaves.

74
00:04:03.393 --> 00:04:08.934
"Prince of Jolliginki," Polynesia used a woman's voice.

75
00:04:08.954 --> 00:04:10.455
"Who's there?"

76
00:04:11.035 --> 00:04:12.015
the prince mumbled.

77
00:04:12.035 --> 00:04:16.976
"I am your fairy godmother," Polynesia said.

78
00:04:16.996 --> 00:04:19.317
"My fairy godmother?"

79
00:04:19.857 --> 00:04:20.877
the prince repeated.

80
00:04:20.897 --> 00:04:25.399
"I'll give you one wish," Polynesia said.

81
00:04:28.379 --> 00:04:30.220
The prince could not believe it.

82
00:04:31.180 --> 00:04:32.200
"Anything I want?"

83
00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:33.541
he asked again.

84
00:04:33.561 --> 00:04:36.121
"Yes," she answered.

85
00:04:36.141 --> 00:04:38.222
"I wish I had hair!"

86
00:04:39.022 --> 00:04:40.583
The prince closed his eyes.

87
00:04:41.303 --> 00:04:43.243
Polynesia's plan was working!

88
00:04:43.263 --> 00:04:46.544
"Find Dr.

89
00:04:46.584 --> 00:04:52.006
Dolittle. He has a magic bottle," Polynesia told the smiling prince.

90
00:04:52.026 --> 00:04:53.546
"Where is he?"

91
00:04:54.026 --> 00:04:54.886
the prince asked.

92
00:04:54.906 --> 00:04:57.327
"In your father's dungeon.

93
00:04:57.767 --> 00:05:00.488
You must go tonight, after dark."

94
00:05:01.149 --> 00:05:04.099
With that, the fairy godmother disappeared.
